# Build-context filter for the ADMIN image (apps/admin/Dockerfile). BuildKit prefers
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the repo-root .dockerignore, which is tuned for the API image and
# excludes apps/admin. Keep root config + packages/shared + apps/admin; drop everything else so the
# context stays small and the layer cache stable.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/.next
docs
infra
apps/api
apps/mobile
*.md
.env
.env.*
